# SkillStitch Environment Configuration
# ==================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values below.
//
// Required environment variables:
# - NEXTAUTH_SECRET: A long random string (>=32 chars) for JWT signing
#   Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# - NEXTAUTH_URL: Base URL (e.g. http://localhost:3000 or https://yourdomain.com)
#
# Optional for GitHub OAuth:
# - GITHUB_ID: GitHub OAuth client ID (from https://github.com/settings/developers)
# - GITHUB_SECRET: GitHub OAuth client secret
#
# Optional for AI (local Ollama):
# - SKILLSTITCH_AI: on/off (default: off)
# - OLLAMA_BASE_URL: http://127.0.0.1:11434 (default)
# - OLLAMA_MODEL: gemma4:26b (or any model registered with `ollama pull`)
# - OLLAMA_TIMEOUT_MS: 240000 (milliseconds, default 240s)
#
# SQLite:
# - SKILLSTITCH_DB_PATH: ./data/skillstitch.db (default, relative to project root)
#
# Example .env file:
# ================
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
# NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
# GITHUB_ID=your-github-id
# GITHUB_SECRET=your-github-secret